SUMMARY:Femme Friday: 3rd Friday DJ Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Every 3rd Friday\, The Velvet Hippo hosts a dance party with beats by some of the Triangle’s best woman and NB DJs! These baddies will bring the heat so you can dance the night away under a ceiling of glittering disco balls. Come see your favorites from around the area\, and discover new artists to follow! Drink specials\, no cover\, 21+ with valid ID to enter.
