SUMMARY:Oyster Roast at Ponysaurus Brewing Co.!
DESCRIPTION:We’re throwing another all-you-can-eat oyster roast on October 17 from 2–5pm\, featuring local oysters! \n🦪 All-you-can-eat roasted oysters with saltines\, lemon\, cocktail sauce\, and horseradish\n🌽 Steamed and buttered local corn and potatoes tossed with Old Bay and chives\n🍺 Our beloved Oyster Saison is returning for the occasion\, brewed with actual oyster shells! \nTickets are available now through October 13 or until they sell out!
