SUMMARY:OMFG! You Grew A Tail!
DESCRIPTION:Congratulations! Your body has developed a tail. \nWe have absolutely no idea how this happened. \nIn this hands-on workshop\, you’ll fabricate your very own fully functioning LED tail from scratch. We’ll provide the materials\, tools\, and questionable scientific supervision. You provide the willingness to grow something weird. \nNo experience necessary. You’ll learn how to shape\, sew and stuff your tail\, then install the LED system and bring your new appendage to life. Your finished tail has multiple animated lighting modes\, so you can switch up your glow depending on your mood\, your outfit\, or whatever mysterious creature you have decided to become. \nAnd yes\, you get to take your new body modification home. \nYour new tail is perfect for your next Halloween costume\, rave\, or just being dramatically more interesting than anyone else. \n• Minimum age: 16.\n• No experience needed.\n• Approximate time: 1–1.5 hours.\n• 6 people per session.\n• $50 workshop fee + tax includes all materials and tools. \nWorkshop dates and times:\n• Tue Oct 13: 6:00 – 8:00 PM\n• Thu Oct 15: 7:00 – 9:00 PM\n• Sat Oct 17: 2:00 – 4:00 PM\n• Sat Oct 17: 4:00 – 6:00 PM\n• Wed Oct 28: 6:00 – 8:00 PM
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/omfg-you-grew-a-tail/2026-10-17/
LOCATION:Future Hooman\, 109 W Orange St\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/discover-durham-tails.jpg
GEO:35.9960535;-78.9003979
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Future Hooman 109 W Orange St Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=109 W Orange St:geo:-78.9003979,35.9960535
END:VEVENT
