SUMMARY:Live Music at ATC
DESCRIPTION:Come to the Lawn at American Tobacco Campus this Saturday afternoon and enjoy the sweet\, homegrown bluegrass sounds of Screamin’ Bridge. \nThe band will then reassemble at 6pm as The Martin County Ramblers to perform a Southern Rock show\, and trust us\, they are GOOD. \nThis is a free show\, open to the public\, and all are welcome. Bring a lawn chair or blanket\, purchase food and drinks from ATC restaurants\, and enjoy some tunes outdoors!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/live-music-at-atc-4/
