SUMMARY:Bull City BOOs Fest
DESCRIPTION:Join The MAKRS Society for our 5th annual Halloween Festival at Durham Central Park!\nTicket prices going down this year! $5 and $10.\nCostumes Encouraged!!\nMake sure to read the entire description so you don’t miss out on any details.\nCool People. Cool Stuff.  THE FOOD: No good festival skimps on the the food and drinks. We have selected some of the best food trucks\, bakeries\, desserts and drink vendors in the area! We’ll have 10-15 food trucks\, breweries\, cideries\, wine\, desserts and much more!\nTHE PERFORMANCES: What’s a Halloween Festival without performers? Get ready for some awesome performances from Dakota Fox Entertainment!\nTHE MUSIC: 2026 will feature a live DJ keeping the vibes going all night long!\nTHE EXPERIENCE: Get ready for the ultimate Halloween experience with lasers\, fog\, stilt walkers\, tarot card readers\, costume contests\, a selfie wall and much more!\nVendor Applications: https://www.eventeny.com/events/vendor/?id=46443\nFood Truck Applications: https://www.eventeny.com/events/vendor/?id=46444\nEvent Website: https://makrs.com/bull-city-boos-fest\nTicket prices going down this year! $5 and $10.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/bull-city-boos-fest/
