SUMMARY:Fate & Folklore's Samhain Market at Zeitgeist
DESCRIPTION:Join Fate & Folklore fora. Samhain to remember! Mid October you’ll find us hosting a night market from 6pm-10pm at Zeitgeist Bar with Hatch Burritos and Night School Bar.\nThere will be state fair inspired food\, limited edition cocktails\, a bone thrower\, and of course our local vendors.\nNight school bar will be hosting an hour long informational talk and discussion of the significance of witches in our every day lives and modern practices.\nWe couldn’t be more excited for this collaboration. Come find the community and witchy discussion you’ve been looking for this Samhain October 17th.
