SUMMARY:Aloreing Destinations: Tickets Please!
DESCRIPTION:Join the Museum of Durham History and the Ghost Guild at 7:00 p.m. in the Fullsteam Theater at the American Tobacco Campus for Aloreing Destinations: Tickets Please! a spooky evening where we will explore some of North Carolina’s most historic and reportedly haunted performance venues\, including Durham’s Carolina Theatre. Drawing on The Ghost Guild’s research and investigation work\, the presentation will explore stories of tragic backstage legends\, unexplained occurrences\, and the traditions that have kept ghost stories alive in theaters long after the final curtain. Doors open with complimentary appetizers and a cash bar in the Stoker Club\, located at the Fullsteam Theater. Following the event there will be a Q&A and mingling with The Ghost Guild team and fellow history and paranormal enthusiasts in Lucky’s Den/Fullsteam Public House. Admission is free\, but you must reserve a ticket in advance below.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/aloreing-destinations-tickets-please/
LOCATION:American Tobacco Campus\, 705 Willard St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:History,Museum
